<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Static Web Page</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #0066cc;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        main {
            width: 80%;
            margin: 25px auto;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        img {
            width: 400px;
            display: block;
            margin: 20px auto;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        a {
            color: #0066cc;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to My Web Page</h1>
        <p><i>A simple static HTML website</i></p>
    </header>

    <main>

        <h2>About This Page</h2>

        <p>
            This is a <b>static web page</b> created using
            <strong>HTML</strong> and CSS.
        </p>

        <p>
            HTML is used to <em>structure</em> web pages.
            We can also use <u>text formatting</u> to make
            important information stand out.
        </p>

        <h2>Image</h2>

        <img src="https://picsum.photos/400/250"
             alt="Sample landscape image">

        <h2>Useful Links</h2>

        <p>
            Visit the following websites:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>
                <a href="https://www.google.com" target="_blank">
                    Google
                </a>
            </li>

            <li>
                <a href="https://www.wikipedia.org" target="_blank">
                    Wikipedia
                </a>
            </li>

            <li>
                <a href="https://www.w3.org" target="_blank">
                    W3C
                </a>
            </li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            <mark>This text is highlighted.</mark>
            You can also use <del>deleted text</del> and
            <small>small text</small>.
        </p>

    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 My Static Web Page</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>